# Build and test artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Runtime state: machine-written and volatile, and the design treats .orchestrator/ as "not packaged".
#
# NOTE: two files in there are human-authored policy rather than state - human-code.txt and
# allowed-edits.txt. If you want their history, un-ignore just those two by adding:
#     !.orchestrator/human-code.txt
#     !.orchestrator/allowed-edits.txt
# and keeping the directory itself ignored, or track those two paths explicitly.
.orchestrator/
